# ===========================================================================
# SENSOR.COMMUNITY EXPANSION — NO2 + VOC + Zusätzliche Sensortypen
# API: https://data.sensor.community/airrohr/v1/
# Endpunkte:
#   /filter/country=<CC>              → Alle Sensoren in einem Land
#   /filter/type=<sensortype>         → Nach Sensortyp gefiltert
#   /filter/box=<lat_min,lon_min,lat_max,lon_max>  → Bounding Box
# Sensor-Typen mit NO2/VOC:
#   SPS30 → PM + VOC
#   SEN5x → Multi-Gas (PM + NOx + VOC + Humidity)
#   MICS6814 → NO2, CO, NH3
#   SGP30 → VOC (tVOC, eCO2)
#   SHT31 → Temperatur + Feuchte
# Force: diffusion (Gaskonzentration)
# TTL: 300 (Echtzeit, 5-Minuten-Updates)
# ===========================================================================

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# [38] Sensor.Community — SEN5x Multi-Gas Sensoren (NO2 + PM + VOC)
#      Neueste Generation: Bosch/Sensirion SEN50/SEN54/SEN55
#      Felder: sensordatavalues[] mit value_type (NOx_index, VOC_index, P1, P2)
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
source sensor_community_sen5x_global
ttl 300
force diffusion
url https://data.sensor.community/airrohr/v1/filter/type=SEN5X
map .
lat_key location.latitude
lon_key location.longitude
field sensordatavalues.NOx_index nox_index
field sensordatavalues.VOC_index voc_index
field sensordatavalues.P1 pm10_ugm3
field sensordatavalues.P2 pm25_ugm3
field location.altitude altitude_m

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# [39] Sensor.Community — MICS6814 (NO2 + CO + NH3 Gassensoren)
#      Elektrochemische Mehrgassensoren, geringere Präzision als SEN5x
#      Felder: NO2, CO, NH3 in µg/m³-Äquivalent
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
source sensor_community_mics6814_no2
ttl 300
force diffusion
url https://data.sensor.community/airrohr/v1/filter/type=MICS6814
map .
lat_key location.latitude
lon_key location.longitude
field sensordatavalues.NO2 no2_ugm3
field sensordatavalues.CO co_ugm3
field sensordatavalues.NH3 nh3_ugm3
field location.altitude altitude_m

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# [40] Sensor.Community — SGP30/SGP40 (VOC + eCO2)
#      MOx-Gassensoren für flüchtige organische Verbindungen
