## Kritische Parser-Hinweise Batch 4

```
# ===== BOM FTP-Feeds (JSON) ================================================
# Alle IDx60901.json-Feeds haben identische Struktur:
# {
#   "observations": {
#     "notice": [...],
#     "header": [...],
#     "data": [
#       {
#         "sort_order": 0,
#         "wmo": 94767,
#         "name": "Sydney (Observatory Hill)",
#         "history_product": "IDN60901",
#         "local_date_time": "27/07:00pm",
#         "local_date_time_full": "20260727170000",
#         "aifstime_utc": "20260727070000",
#         "lat": -33.9,
#         "lon": 151.2,
#         "apparent_t": 22.6,
#         "cloud": "Partly cloudy",
#         "cloud_base_m": null,
#         "cloud_type": "Cumulus",
#         "delta_t": 5.4,
#         "gust_kmh": 26,
#         "gust_kt": 14,
#         "air_temp": 25.2,
#         "dewpt": 14.0,
#         "press": 1018.1,
#         "press_msl": 1018.1,
#         "press_qnh": 1018.0,
#         "press_tend": "-",
#         "rain_trace": "0.0",
#         "rel_hum": 50,
#         "sea_state": "-",
#         "swell_dir_worded": "-",
#         "swell_height": null,
#         "swell_period": null,
#         "vis_km": "10",
#         "weather": "-",
#         "wind_dir": "NE",
#         "wind_spd_kmh": 11,
#         "wind_spd_kt": 6
#       }, ...
#     ]
#   }
# }
# → map observations.data
# → lat_key lat, lon_key lon
# → rain_trace ist STRING ("0.0", "Trace", "-") → Ingestor muss parsen

# ===== FDSN Station Text Format ============================================
# Zeile 1: #Network|Station|Location|Channel|Latitude|Longitude|
#           Elevation|Depth|Azimuth|Dip|SensorDescription|Scale|
#           ScaleFreq|ScaleUnits|SampleRate|StartTime|EndTime
# Zeile 2+: AM|R1607||EHZ|48.123|11.456|520.0|0.0|0.0|-90.0|
#           Raspberry Shake 1D|600000000.0|1.0|M/S|100.0|
#           2019-03-15T12:00:00|
# → format text + rows
# → lat_key Latitude (aus Header-Zeile gemappt)
# → Kopfzeile beginnt mit "#" → überspringen
# → Pipe-Delimiter → Ingestor muss "| " als Trenner konfigurieren

# ===== OpenAQ v3 API ======================================================
# Neue v3-Struktur unterscheidet sich von v2:
# {
#   "meta": {"name": "openaq-api", "page": 1, ...},
#   "results": [
#     {
#       "id": 12345,
#       "location_id": 678,
#       "sensors_id": 90,
#       "value": 15.6,
#       "datetime": {"utc": "2026-07-27T12:00:00Z", ...},
#       "coordinates": {"latitude": 48.1, "longitude": 11.5},
