# ICECUBE NEUTRINO ALERTS — GCN/AMON ECHTZEIT
# GCN Notices AMON: https://gcn.gsfc.nasa.gov/amon_icecube_gold_bronze_events.html
# GCN REST API (neu): https://gcn.nasa.gov/api/v0.1/
# AMON Table: http://www.amon.psu.edu/amon_icecube_gold_bronze_events.html
# Öffentlich, kein Auth
# Force: em (hochenergetische Neutrinos = Begleit-EM-Quelle)
# ⚠ Neutrinos selbst sind keine EM-Strahlung; force=em weil
#   Neutrino-Quellen (AGN, GRBs) primär EM-Emitter sind
# TTL: 300 (Gold-Alerts ~10/Jahr, Bronze ~30/Jahr)
# ===========================================================================

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# [1] AMON — IceCube Gold-Alerts Echtzeit (p_astro > 50%, Track-artig)
#     Gold: mittlere astrophysikalische Reinheit 50%
#     FAR ≈ 0.1-0.5 /Jahr (sehr selten)
#     AMON REST: öffentliche HTML-Tabelle → format text + rows
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
source amon_icecube_gold_alerts
ttl 300
force em
url https://gcn.gsfc.nasa.gov/amon_icecube_gold_bronze_events.html
format text
rows
lat_key dec
lon_key ra
field stream alert_stream
field rev revision
field id event_id
field ra ra_deg
field dec dec_deg
field energy energy_proxy_TeV
field signalness p_astro
field far false_alarm_rate_yr
field src_error_90 error_radius_90_deg
field event_time detection_utc

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# [2] AMON — IceCube Bronze-Alerts (p_astro > 30%, höhere Rate)
#     Bronze: ~30% astrophysikalische Reinheit, ~3× mehr Alerts als Gold
#     Wichtig für Multi-Messenger Follow-up-Programme
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
source amon_icecube_bronze_alerts
ttl 300
force em
url https://gcn.gsfc.nasa.gov/amon_icecube_gold_bronze_events.html
format text
rows
lat_key dec
lon_key ra
field stream alert_stream
field id event_id
field ra ra_deg
field dec dec_deg
field energy energy_proxy_TeV
field signalness p_astro
field far false_alarm_rate_yr
field src_error_90 error_radius_90_deg

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# [3] GCN REST API — Aktuelle IceCube Circulars (NASA GCN v0.1)
#     GCN Circulars REST: alle aktuellen Circulars inkl. IceCube
#     Öffentlich, kein Auth: https://gcn.nasa.gov/api/v0.1/circulars
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
source gcn_icecube_circulars_recent
